---
title: What We Believe In
layout: layouts/default.njk
navbar: navbar1
footer: footer1
colorModifier: dark
permalink: about.html
---
<div class="container">
  <div class="row d-flex justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-12 text-center py-vh-3">
      <h1>{{title}}</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="col-10 col-lg-10 col-xl-9 border-bottom border-top py-vh-3">
      <div class="row">
        <ol>
          <li>A positive, empathetic, supportive, collaborative, free and open creative environment is the best one to help us, both collectively and individually, achieve our artistic goals and ambitions.</li></br>
          <li>Every project we do will provide value collectively and individually. We credit individuals for their contribution, but we share in the success of our projects collectively.</li></br>
          <li>Each member of each project is valuable and important, and should be treated as such.</br></br>
          <li>We support each other. Together, we're stronger and more courageous.</li></br>
          <li>We strive to communicate frequently and openly. We are open and honest with each other. We are also careful to be critical in a constructive and respectful manner.</li></br>
          <li>We recognize that organization and intentionality are critical parts of the success of every project. Each person will make the effort to read messages in group chats, respond to requests in a timely manner, and keep the big picture in mind.</li></br>
          <li>Not everyone needs to (or can) be involved in every project, but everyone needs to offer their support and constructive feedback if asked.</li></br>
          <li>We strive to operate democratically and in a decentralized way as much as possible.</li></br>
          <li>We strive to assume the best of each other, have patience with each other, and commit to earning each other's trust.</li></br>
          <li>If we start a project, we strive to finish the project.</li></br>
          <li>We strive to grow our individual skills independently and bring that learning back to the collective.</li></br>
          <li>We are committed to fundraising efforts that will cover the costs of our projects, and eventually compensate each artist for their valuable time.</li></ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 text-center py-vh-3">
      <h1>Members</h1></br>
      <div class="member-columns">
        {%- for member in collections.members -%}
        <article class="image_wrapper member-card">
          <img src="{{ member.data.img | toWebp }}" class="w-100 shadow-1-strong rounded" alt="{{ member.data.name }}" decoding="async">
          <div class="overlay overlay_3 white-text">
            <h3>{{ member.data.name }}</h3>
            {%- if member.data.instagram -%}
            &nbsp;
            &nbsp;
            <h3><a href="https://www.instagram.com/{{ member.data.instagram }}" class="link-fancy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{ member.data.name }} on Instagram"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></h3>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </article>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
